# env.optional — CRM live-read + export targets; the skill runs keyless (--crm csv) without any.
# If a CRM key is set, fetch_deals.py pulls deals live from that CRM; if not, use --crm csv
# (the default keyless path). Set exactly the one matching your --crm:
# --crm hubspot; private-app token
HUBSPOT_API_KEY
# --crm pipedrive
PIPEDRIVE_API_TOKEN
# --crm close
CLOSE_API_KEY
# --crm salesforce
SALESFORCE_ACCESS_TOKEN
# --crm salesforce
SALESFORCE_INSTANCE_URL
# Export targets — used solely if you export the finished report:
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON   (Google Sheets export)
# NOTION_API_KEY                (Notion export)
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN               (Slack summary push)
# SENDGRID_API_KEY              (email the report)
